<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intermedia started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intermedia started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it initiated coverage of Intermedia Communications Inc with an accumulate rating intermediate-term and a buy rating long-term.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Intermedia Communications closed at 31-5/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
